            "activity_label": {
                "da": "Dagsorden for tirsdag \u2013 Anmodning fra Renew-Gruppen \u2013 Reduktion af amerikansk milit\u00e6r deployering i Europa",
                "nl": "Agenda van dinsdag \u2013 Verzoek van de Renew-Fractie \u2013 De verminderde militaire inzet van de VS in Europa",
                "de": "Tagesordnung f\u00fcr Dienstag \u2013 Antrag der Renew-Fraktion \u2013 Abbau der milit\u00e4rischen Pr\u00e4senz der Vereinigten Staaten in Europa",
                "bg": "\u0414\u043d\u0435\u0432\u0435\u043d \u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0437\u0430 \u0432\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043d\u0438\u043a \u2013 \u0418\u0441\u043a\u0430\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043f\u0430\u0442\u0430 Renew \u2013 \u041d\u0430\u043c\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043e \u0432\u043e\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0441\u044a\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u0421\u0410\u0429 \u0432 \u0415\u0432\u0440\u043e\u043f\u0430",
                "sv": "Tisdagens f\u00f6redragningslista \u2013 beg\u00e4ran fr\u00e5n Renew-gruppen \u2013 Minskad amerikansk milit\u00e4r n\u00e4rvaro i Europa",
                "pt": "Ordem do dia de ter\u00e7a-feira \u2013 Pedido do Grupo Renew \u2013 Redu\u00e7\u00e3o do destacamento militar dos Estados Unidos na Europa",
                "cs": "\u00datern\u00ed po\u0159ad jedn\u00e1n\u00ed \u2013 \u017e\u00e1dost skupiny Renew \u2013 Omezen\u00ed americk\u00e9 vojensk\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edtomnosti v Evrop\u011b",
                "hr": "Dnevni red za utorak \u2013 Zahtjev Kluba zastupnika Renew \u2013 Smanjenje ameri\u010dke vojne prisutnosti u Europi",
                "lv": "Otrdienas darba k\u0101rt\u012bba - grupas \u201cRenew\u201d piepras\u012bjums - ASV milit\u0101rpersonu kontingenta samazin\u0101\u0161ana Eirop\u0101",
                "el": "\u0397\u03bc\u03b5\u03c1\u03ae\u03c3\u03b9\u03b1 \u03b4\u03b9\u03ac\u03c4\u03b1\u03be\u03b7 \u03a4\u03c1\u03af\u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u2013 \u0391\u03af\u03c4\u03b7\u03bc\u03b1 \u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u039f\u03bc\u03ac\u03b4\u03b1\u03c2 Renew \u2013 \u039c\u03b5\u03af\u03c9\u03c3\u03b7 \u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u03b1\u03bd\u03ac\u03c0\u03c4\u03c5\u03be\u03b7\u03c2 \u03c3\u03c4\u03c1\u03b1\u03c4\u03b9\u03c9\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ce\u03bd \u03b4\u03c5\u03bd\u03ac\u03bc\u03b5\u03c9\u03bd \u03c4\u03c9\u03bd \u0397\u03a0\u0391 \u03c3\u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u0395\u03c5\u03c1\u03ce\u03c0\u03b7",
                "it": "Ordine del giorno di marted\u00ec \u2013 Richiesta del gruppo Renew \u2013 Riduzione del dispiegamento militare degli Stati Uniti in Europa",
                "et": "Teisip\u00e4eva p\u00e4evakord \u2013 fraktsiooni Renew taotlus \u2013 USA v\u00e4hendatud s\u00f5jaline kohalolek Euroopas",
                "ro": "Ordinea de zi de mar\u021bi \u2013 Cererea Grupului Renew \u2013 Reducerea for\u021belor armate ale SUA desf\u0103\u0219urate \u00een Europa",
                "mt": "A\u0121enda tat-Tlieta - Talba tal-Grupp Renew \u2013 Tnaqqis fl-istazzjonament militari tal-Istati Uniti fl-Ewropa",
                "sl": "Torkov dnevni red \u2013 zahteva skupine Renew \u2013 Zmanj\u0161anje napotenih ameri\u0161kih voja\u0161kih sil v Evropi",
                "hu": "Keddi napirend \u2013 a Renew k\u00e9pvisel\u0151csoport k\u00e9relme \u2013 Az Egyes\u00fclt \u00c1llamok katonai jelenl\u00e9t\u00e9nek cs\u00f6kkent\u00e9se Eur\u00f3p\u00e1ban",
                "pl": "Porz\u0105dek obrad we wtorek \u2013 wniosek grupy Renew \u2013 Ograniczenie rozmieszczenia wojsk USA w Europie",
                "fi": "Tiistain esityslista \u2013 Renew -ryhm\u00e4n pyynt\u00f6 \u2013 Yhdysvaltain sotilaallisten joukkojen v\u00e4hent\u00e4minen Euroopassa",
                "ga": "Cl\u00e1r Oibre D\u00e9 M\u00e1irt - Iarraidh \u00f3n nGr\u00fapa Renew - Laghd\u00fa ar imscaradh m\u00edleata na St\u00e1t Aontaithe san Eoraip",
                "mul": "Ordre du jour de mardi - Demande du groupe Renew - R\u00e9duction du d\u00e9ploiement militaire des \u00c9tats-Unis en Europe",
                "fr": "Ordre du jour de mardi - Demande du groupe Renew - R\u00e9duction du d\u00e9ploiement militaire des \u00c9tats-Unis en Europe",
                "lt": "Antradienio darbotvark\u0117 - Renew frakcijos pra\u0161ymas - Suma\u017eintas Europoje dislokuojam\u0173 JAV kari\u0173 skai\u010dius",
                "sk": "Program utorkov\u00e9ho rokovania \u2013 \u017eiados\u0165 skupiny Renew \u2013 Obmedzenie vojensk\u00e9ho nasadenia USA v Eur\u00f3pe",
                "en": "Tuesday\u2019s agenda \u2013 Request by the Renew Group \u2013 Reduced US military deployment in Europe",
                "es": "Orden del d\u00eda del martes - Solicitud del Grupo\u00a0Renew - Reducci\u00f3n del despliegue militar estadounidense en Europa"
            },
